    "closed": true,
    "closedAt": "2023-10-17T10:25:49Z",
    "comment_count": 2,
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author": {
                "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1154912?u=c5844a16e7897cd2f4f18f29d2f7df9e52b83cac&v=4",
                "login": "heygarrett",
                "resourcePath": "/heygarrett",
                "url": "https://github.com/heygarrett"
            },
            "authorAssociation": "NONE",
            "body": "Well, I figured out that, using the `buf_id` passed to the preview function, I can do:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nvim.bo[buf_id].filetype = \"diff\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis provides highlighting for the output of `git diff` and `git show`.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Well, I figured out that, using the <code class=\"notranslate\">buf_id</code> passed to the preview function, I can do:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"vim.bo[buf_id].filetype = &quot;diff&quot;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">bo</span>[<span class=\"pl-smi\">buf_id</span>].<span class=\"pl-e\">filetype</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>diff<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This provides highlighting for the output of <code class=\"notranslate\">git diff</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">git show</code>.</p>",
            "bodyText": "Well, I figured out that, using the buf_id passed to the preview function, I can do:\nvim.bo[buf_id].filetype = \"diff\"\nThis provides highlighting for the output of git diff and git show.",
