        {
            "author": {
                "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24854248?u=d09fd974c6720eba3039db6beb2f1c1efecdb51d&v=4",
                "login": "echasnovski",
                "resourcePath": "/echasnovski",
                "url": "https://github.com/echasnovski"
            },
            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I plan to release `git_commits` picker as a [part of an upcoming 'mini.extra' module](https://github.com/echasnovski/nvim/blob/901f8e693f7834965f8c8fd3aa5fb514a090b74b/lua/mini-dev/extra.lua#L348-L390).\r\n\r\nYes, setting `'diff'` filetype is the way to go to have proper buffer highlighting.\r\n\r\nTo have highlighting for line parts, update `source.show()` to use `default_show()` followed by setting custom `extmarks` which highlight regions. See `:h extmarks` and `:h nvim_buf_set_extmarks`.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I plan to release <code class=\"notranslate\">git_commits</code> picker as a <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/nvim/blob/901f8e693f7834965f8c8fd3aa5fb514a090b74b/lua/mini-dev/extra.lua#L348-L390\">part of an upcoming 'mini.extra' module</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Yes, setting <code class=\"notranslate\">'diff'</code> filetype is the way to go to have proper buffer highlighting.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To have highlighting for line parts, update <code class=\"notranslate\">source.show()</code> to use <code class=\"notranslate\">default_show()</code> followed by setting custom <code class=\"notranslate\">extmarks</code> which highlight regions. See <code class=\"notranslate\">:h extmarks</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">:h nvim_buf_set_extmarks</code>.</p>",
            "bodyText": "I plan to release git_commits picker as a part of an upcoming 'mini.extra' module.\nYes, setting 'diff' filetype is the way to go to have proper buffer highlighting.\nTo have highlighting for line parts, update source.show() to use default_show() followed by setting custom extmarks which highlight regions. See :h extmarks and :h nvim_buf_set_extmarks.",
